  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df8511906e064307b5eadea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有忘记领取的东西呢？\r\n别慌张，\r\n慢慢检查～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab3b04ca6f709c9786a8572c7b04eb815896d36c2b58ccb5d8509c28402989a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0051c2d5dca2f011160b630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请收下圣诞节的魔法～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f980f9091050ed3a6c55d3c4aa7340b6449e9e9932ff5c6b5fd4c10e84128fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f17663bc8026875cbd170ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那里是闪耀的童话王国　装满珍贵梦想的宝箱\r\n现在施下魔法　圣诞快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "739f5327a6db088df66950bcd3aa53d871c678dd32c789c69aab6b0beee82cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c526a1430d715110849578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的老粉丝们也都\r\n很有个性喔～。每当和“姐姐推”\r\n的粉丝聊天时，总是特别投机",
      "source_fingerprint": "b238cd2e38c3bf00e9f87684f74c06cc4d17782866be03717eb5308771e05fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435864793c87741d5adbec0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来是想报答恩情的……\r\n结果却从赖恩姐姐、粉丝们那里\r\n反过来，我收获了大家的笑容呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "234f58f701d134e79b39ad8667feed65e17dff88f73de550d4b8a842a64cfeb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8600697a327319ec71e985b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "潘多拉小姐送给我的照片，\r\n我有用相框装饰起来哦。唔呼呼，\r\n每次看到都能获得满满的活力呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "864f3fd927d2f0e9473027cfc046cfa85d31ce0ea282b3448e7307f53baef81f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2479207e314a6fa7bc806c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续前进吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "447d59e057f729b91f782923e0dd89cfb145f0198cf18fc59bb234b0ae47f6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a875b2810b02188ffa7d334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是为了任何人……这一切，只为了我自己。\r\n这个夏天……无论如何，我都不会忘记。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c5d412bde3854c44f6b7c8b62a829b63716e941283ad1289bab53a9511b40b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ed7016b0a17bbe4b72a218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18eabea1cbd46042a2f43364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a21842da2da756d2638312d58df5cabcef4c00e2156cd5fcf55995c8af404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:373508fbba5dd4799f62de36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "328a8e01a4779c219c6db166de85bc4a9f21f4b0234525881d95b2454d9903c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d7b222c4b320f4a6bf62f5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "328a8e01a4779c219c6db166de85bc4a9f21f4b0234525881d95b2454d9903c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
