        "1074",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d0bbb085aee741605ed055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将上场展现我的光芒～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8350672d55a7ebfb5f25c11fb662575614800b6b9f2ef7547349583af21fc60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a70708e2a3681446dff64f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该怎么样才能跟上舞步呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f934bc2102c91bddb0ad5164b591cdbd843d28b5e07045a80f5d50ddd034eb07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c31953870f828ce79d28ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……轮到我登场了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca0518567271855ac7c237cbd2f4c0802fe631a239779dcb7c4ee72f57a989b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a451a011256f72c6111ee6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错……\r\n当时在我身边的\r\n正是训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f18b4ec07d2530d5390f219b48056212561da2f9902b3a7a8b880de87632440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceafc835bc2da622993c467b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟姐姐们同款……\r\n我非常喜欢呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f7c1f9c110e942d319d3ceb105cafab2121cac2e24df30e92e2eaa74bae00a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac5fa576d4a9f4eae9fca8e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘、满满荷叶边……♪\r\n我很喜欢喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "32ae925b6007f0e6212177c04657d5d31cea8bb95b969853d286d4c7fea7dd53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf5b112103cb32937d599c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装既可爱……同时，\r\n也带来令人感到骄傲的荣光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "289c2abd8ab4468e97ae45c5aba5ba33ce6486cc0d6472d76e6ace9a75bf818b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b1295ee735a8c0cce39d10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "告诉你一个秘密，\r\n其实我午休时很容易入睡喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9ba8bc50de817596b7dee75097e710de046223c030cbba2325a1a211508645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3ddb06c12d9dd5d444ad51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身后的缎带好可爱，\r\n我很喜欢喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f005539a734f4e2221be0877a8f42e0e174591e069cd13a66592e360cf1c5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4395d3eddb10736e2099ef8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深深理解……穿上这个颜色\r\n其中代表的沉重意义～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cfb2bf6baaec0e99d14cccf969b12db843f0e2a4b0afd132f54337e027b47cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce6a500e8f1b10b203f49eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变身成圣诞老人～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8888b361fa6d59bf46de29ebd62eaed92089c5e9d2f5e407d755ecbb93438552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30551ed87a7aa4fc797f9797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要抱一下吗？\r\n软乎乎的喔～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80cb1b41f24ecb42a4b9acd3d286b31573f77699e610580b1263167e30404e3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c052869beee53953befee8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，提起干劲努力啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a88c39bb262ea22b95f5c763737197077c6e76e5b03bbaf51d5a21104e9bfd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ad0de3f4f64bdcfa02d6a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e51722fa8691229d925ec454d638cb9e70f8bcb854a5737ed73ea2802295492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7173daf6a00199550c206aee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真开心呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139cdab9e0ffbf145160c5cf76041c1072cf785e4873c82f65df95f20863bbc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c93d63c6249fdd4a574b244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要去哪棵树的树荫下休息呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ca64bc06e3e3cb621199ae5e13da5396a22e7b42447cbb94beac752ffdaa77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec90b64c7cca8bf96827abd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也留在沙滩上吧。我们一路走来的足迹",
      "source_fingerprint": "735f225f28a1475a0d7eaeb8a883b982185d3d125fe5299509c3090ad96f0642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
