      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f0908108b52f9608be5333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为足以照耀海之尽头的光……一定会",
      "source_fingerprint": "989d0eecf0b8eec4eb40f084f17e59444c17c19fac7c4a19dcf22257d64769ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e428949d989d24d48014bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "acacb84eebc8ef368ba2afbd6d52004612b3fcd79820f24cb9471c2fb9f9017d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d774518a349b0f98ad666fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛前\r\n先一起喝杯茶吧？\r\n你意下如何～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ed746963abf6b6b185926d96f9e1b258fdaf1f011fad3670b8dc10cdebb611",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f068e9a486cb31020981333d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在等待时机喔～\r\n等待自己最能绽放光芒的那一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b4cacf68df3935396194ce0d8c5eca6af58c82915b7ea8bcf87a12d19509a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c417bf129f6247cb4032e502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……请坐，\r\n这朵云非常柔软喔～\r\n……哎呀？原来是梦啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0dff9c49d9d9b068823d387bdcad4b39c68314785bd3020945ebf4b6d4d970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2c7e4b91af5d24e488be89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天早上我一张开眼睛就会立刻开窗\r\n尽情沐浴阳光。然后又会\r\n因为太舒服开始想睡～",
      "source_fingerprint": "248159c21f7605ebef6ac086ace4819c529eb1e3c31e63864cfc3a71af6a2adc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ad7860ae26c333546910ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "福来嘴里老是\r\n喊着「菠菜」呢～\r\n所以下次我想送她一些当礼物～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a9c048c24286002e136317d19473b3f796e561dd68f4e027eadb461d79d4508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8e1243c5cf6469ee3a751d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当我寻找照得到阳光的地方时，\r\n常常会遇见天空呢～\r\n我称之为暖呼呼时光～",
      "source_fingerprint": "54beaae24995efa67bec2d61dae3c0a211d1c4865678cbbdc7d923686021fe29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525ee245cf6ea417a2bf05f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然月亮非常美丽～但边看月亮\r\n边走路是很危险的～\r\n因为世界上长满了树嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d91059bb69059cfedc64a03b481e2d5a9afe3d981b2e51ded4b24d636b6a7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ce426f523b2bf7012610a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我住在老家时，睡前挑选睡衣\r\n是我每晚的乐趣。\r\n蕾丝睡衣跟丝质睡衣我都很喜欢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8705d189909e40c7bb15cb4b31792f2489f93f3962cb1710a12eaece7e19d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029821acd22bca9ea5194eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天，草木与繁花都萌生新芽……\r\n我也该起身走向\r\n那道向往的光芒了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef7bde8fb8b8bf2bb6e47cd6622dc1f79a69fc35bbf3e73098ca718fbe779ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16617eef40f1922c33c3b6b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气炎热时才更适合泡个热水澡，\r\n畅快地流汗～\r\n洗完澡也别忘了喝杯茶喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b967a9757b3e03ab69c3dc801c97fdd462510a96253d535bd9130a1ed20733bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c4622c50376c08068a4cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "翻开从去年就开始阅读的书，\r\n发现里面夹了一片红叶～\r\n这书签是来自去年的礼物呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ff5e1f0cf9ddc69563ac464af0ad35f142d2e9e77298fdc0f3b097424a134c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2933627f695932a02c58cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的妹妹们都很能干～\r\n冬天出门前，她们常拿出\r\n布料将我层层包起来呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "22cc5de556ec7fbfa40da1bb0a590198f2a586c5618ba33ebd1c3891eb98c90b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f9ed37c2e8f4d9b4efdcc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我呀，会早早起床的喔～。\r\n这样，小鹤大人就不必喊哑嗓子\r\n来叫我起床了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "876ceec6e5c89cdce4187842f0a354f9c892384199f6a7bad7a7b27c3c842d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad8614df78579cb28013f23e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，训练员大人的头发乱了～。\r\n呵呵，我来用梳子替您整理。\r\n打扮得像小槙一样可爱",
      "source_fingerprint": "50bcab3f4c5b0e2df54b21269bd57cb0ac62ff34f2b2626e51ed0675e7950037",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58f43c3a7b925554d1b76b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次做姜饼时，\r\n等到用模具压制时面团都会变得干巴巴的\r\n……所以，可以请您帮帮我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8834606357102f0322e21fff206b9d510521d9b6b002440d3b871ec1000d6227",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b35f61b66cdc54733beb9e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……差不多该睡午觉了……可是，\r\n好不容易，多伯才帮我把头发整理好\r\n了……可不能弄乱…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f8cb8db7874906af4a4065e3beb2da065737beb314cff4f7d3c00cd00c69b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9a609387244a5afe3d16653",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜里要悄悄展开行动喔～\r\n如果早上，枕边没有礼物\r\n还请期待第二天～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9045901f4898710249210e9d531d7658087354d69886ad40a1e3d3736037b98f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae571b19692b9618ac7175c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都睡着前圣诞老人是不能行动的\r\n呢。所以，我会一动不动地\r\n等着喔。一～～～直等着…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acc371bc24ba865774b07cded3f6e71ee3daea65e42320963c9b55817254e86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f114f43f717143ae1467786",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖洋洋的真舒服呢～。\r\n我想，春天一定是为熬过寒冬的大家\r\n送来了礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2586ed7c29fb8bfa42a516820377ad3e2259a8a3fe269490959214f57e7a5c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b87e161c16db5304dfcd92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在私人海滩时，我喜欢躺在浮排上\r\n悠闲地漂浮\r\n还曾经漂到过无人岛呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd5a744b8b4b09a29158c1ab3b060b331cf7c44a7325530bd16e8d0bca3176b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d287996d928ae8397feef2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从春天开始织的袜子，也终于\r\n织到脚后跟了～。无论如何\r\n争取在圣诞节……新年之前完成～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ac35e79bb8b44f3ea7cc4ba8a48ac5a91f3952b086c33ab329fa53e487a1582",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ef8a3815cb3a1b14f9bbb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，即使很冷我也不会点燃壁炉\r\n而是等待圣诞老人\r\n那时真是满怀期待呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "947fff2e283509c5e6533494d13a823601e8612c9dac79e16d8b584b241ecdbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2d698843671d8c9c1a64cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快～乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0a9171d8bfba7949b0895fe41547ac3189ce3e0162ebef9dea09d68a56c996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0972ccc5bb39f36ce883b390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快～乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0a9171d8bfba7949b0895fe41547ac3189ce3e0162ebef9dea09d68a56c996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a5b89fe94fd2261f5e15b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天，也一起加油吧～。\r\n像海滩上的波浪一样，慢～慢地……\r\n按照我们的步调前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cdbdcefac5d77a17a50e183e4b4ae8256a85eb6816a880bf52242c00e39868a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eae93c2c14fce49b887bfb2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看～♪我的头发，\r\n今天早上，是小鹤大人帮我卷的\r\n呢。呵呵，可得好好珍惜",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd1413683c03e7cb469386a3e1169f57a44f1f78d7040fd17109bd2a21f12c95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1543104411d2cc04ef48b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "播放着海浪声午睡时，\r\n就仿佛在海龟先生背上安睡\r\n一样……非常推荐喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4c1263f72ba8a18a093b18b1b1484d60d320dcc7252b59b5accc1ae4b7bfc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da15d8c00ceaffe20ac42cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的泳池训练\r\n就交给我吧。缓慢而从容地游\r\n……我一直都是这么做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6107a60bac2f27fd3981f7649d73ddbdb6cb123fc7e542cb06e3442c06f11e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa1196754f09cdb4029dc824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次泡澡时，大家总会\r\n关心地提醒我。说要注意别\r\n泡到头晕，诸如此类……呵呵，真感谢大家～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa99bc845e171c5cdbe43724b8bd0214e7e2a7aa15313e7e680fe5bce43771f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b28fbd7d3dbba434bf9a446",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多伯送的香薰让我每晚都\r\n睡得很香～。海洋调的\r\n香气……呼啊……一想起来就困了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2601225025d5b7fc3c3ef85579734412482a6e3ba87ae2454a9377bb88274343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d57527a65fc59afa3d58db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铺满池面的樱花花瓣\r\n实在太梦幻了……因为想着或许会有妖精\r\n所以，我忍不住找了起来",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbdfbf83f967d3fc7c1315e64970a7f7ec7c1e72aa7fc1699848ec1998b569e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92fff4ef0f7636049dd41e27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "套着游泳圈悠悠漂浮，\r\n再和海鸥先生打招呼……\r\n呵呵，真盼着去海边呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d003604f773185288362321433b02afc33fd255c3fc10be6a18d53d38906741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "90217"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
